      <slug></slug>
      <title>Tomoyo Linux for secure embedded (Linux)</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Embedded</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://tomoyo.sourceforge.jp/&#34;&gt;TOMOYO Linux&lt;/a&gt; is a MAC (Mandatory Access Control) implementation for Linux.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It was developed by NTT DATA CORPORATION, Japan and is available under the GPL license. TOMOYO Linux consists of patch files to vanilla kernel and userland tools.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Patch files are provided for both 2.4 and 2.6. For the user&amp;#39;s convenience, various binary packages are also available.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1211">Toshiharu Harada</person>
      </persons>
